// exp(sigma*n - sigma*sigma/2) — strictly positive, mean-preserving, and calibrated
// rather than tuned. Amplitudes derive from data/textures.csv's measured stats when
// a material binds a texture and leaves `cv` blank; the seam/groove DEPTHS are
// authored per family in cube.frag (the CSV measured colour, not depth).

